title: "IMTOP — IMage-TO-Print wound dressings"
abstract: >-
  Desktop tool to calibrate, segment and measure wounds from a single
  photograph (Segment Anything ViT-B / GrabCut / Watershed back-ends) and
  export a printable 3D patch.
